"I should teach the move to.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:339
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_HaventGotEnoughPoints"
msgid ""
"What the…\n"
"You haven't got enough Battle Points!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:343
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_IllTakeBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"Do you see how skilled I am now?\n"
"I'll take your Battle Points, thanks!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:347
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_YouDontWantTo"
msgid ""
"What's that?\n"
"You don't want to…\p"
"If you want to see how skilled I am,\n"
"you come see me anytime!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:353
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_RightTutorIntro"
msgid ""
"Ihihihi!\p"
"I know it's hard to see now, but I used\n"
"to be one fantastic TRAINER.\p"
"I had a reputation as the most\n"
"invincible SWIMMER around, I tell you!\p"
"… … … … … …\p"
"What's wrong?\n"
"You don't believe me.\p"
"I'm not like that buffoonish woman over\n"
"there. I'm actually experienced!\p"
"I can prove it to you.\n"
"I can teach your POKéMON hard and\l"
"yet pretty moves.\p"
"But my lessons don't come free.\n"
"How about paying for the moves I teach\l"
"with a wee bit of Battle Points?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:371
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_RightTutorWelcomeBack"
msgid ""
"Ihihihi!\p"
