#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:376
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_ThinkLadiesDontGetAlong"
msgid ""
"Those ladies, the way they bad-mouth\n"
"each other, you probably think that\l"
"they don't get along.\p"
"But if that were true, they wouldn't\n"
"stay out here together, would they?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_Lounge7/scripts.inc:383
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_Lounge7_Text_LadiesWereStrongAndBeautiful"
msgid ""
"When I was just a wee YOUNGSTER,\n"
"those ladies were strong and beautiful.\p"
"They were idols among us TRAINERS.\p"
"Even now, age hasn't dulled their\n"
"abilities.\p"
"In fact, their POKéMON moves have\n"
"grown even more polished.\p"
"But… For some reason, I can't help\n"
"but feel this…\p"
"Time is so cruel…$"
msgstr ""

